--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library provides inference helpers used by Gst-nvinfer. It implements
DBScan object clustering and decoding of TAO/TLT encoded models into a TensorRT
engine.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- libnvds_inferlogger.so (build and install src/utils/nvdsinfer_logger first)
- libeigen3 Development package
- TensorRT Development libraries (nvinfer, nvinfer_plugin, nvonnxparser)
- OpenSSL Development package (libcrypto)
- CUDA Runtime

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ export CUDA_VER=13.2 # x86, Jetson and SBSA. For IGX Thor, CUDA_VER=13.0
  $ make && sudo -E make install

Skip sudo when already root (for example inside a container).

The library libnvds_inferutils.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
